-- `tween` argument forms: required from/to/over, optional easing, frames vs seconds,
-- and a dotted target.
panel is {x: 0, y: 0}
tween panel.x from 0 to 100 over 1 second
tween panel.y from 0 to 50 over 30 frames ease in
tween panel.x from -20 to 20 over 0.5 seconds ease bounce
tween panel.y to 10 over 12 frames
